#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:52
msgid "Generic Name"
msgstr "通用名稱"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:53
msgid "Generic name of the application, for example \"Web Browser\"."
msgstr "應用程式的通用名稱，例如「網頁瀏覽器」。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:59
msgid "Try Exec"
msgstr "嘗試執行"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:61
msgid ""
"Path to an executable file to determine if the program is installed. If the "
"file is not present or is not executable, this entry may not be shown in a "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"用於判斷程式是否已安裝的可執行檔路徑。若該檔案不存在或無法執行，此項目可能不"
"會顯示在選單中。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:68
msgid "Only Show In"
msgstr "僅在以下環境顯示"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:70
msgid ""
"A list of environments that should display this entry. Other environments "
"will not display this entry. You can only use this key if \"NotShowIn\" is "
"not set.\n"
"Possible values include: Budgie, Cinnamon, EDE, GNOME, KDE, LXDE, LXQt, "
"MATE, Pantheon, Razor, ROX, TDE, Unity, XFCE, Old"
msgstr ""
"應顯示此項目的環境列表。其他環境將不會顯示此項目。只有在未設定「NotShowIn」時"
"才可使用此鍵。\n"
"可能的值包含：Budgie, Cinnamon, EDE, GNOME, KDE, LXDE, LXQt, MATE, Pantheon, "
"Razor, ROX, TDE, Unity, XFCE, Old"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:78
msgid "Not Shown In"
msgstr "不在以下環境顯示"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:80
msgid ""
"A list of environments that should not display this entry. You can only use "
"this key if \"OnlyShowIn\" is not set.\n"
"Possible values include: Budgie, Cinnamon, EDE, GNOME, KDE, LXDE, LXQt, "
"MATE, Pantheon, Razor, ROX, TDE, Unity, XFCE, Old"
msgstr ""
"不應顯示此項目的環境列表。只有在未設定「OnlyShowIn」時才可使用此鍵。\n"
"可能的值包含：Budgie, Cinnamon, EDE, GNOME, KDE, LXDE, LXQt, MATE, Pantheon, "
"Razor, ROX, TDE, Unity, XFCE, Old"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:88
msgid "Mimetypes"
msgstr "MIME 類型"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:89
msgid "The MIME type(s) supported by this application."
msgstr "此應用程式支援的 MIME 類型。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:95
msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "關鍵字"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:97
msgid ""
"A list of keywords to describe this entry. You can use these to help "
"searching entries. These are not meant for display, and should not be "
"redundant with the values of Name or GenericName."
msgstr ""
"用來描述此項目的關鍵字列表。您可以使用它們來協助搜尋項目。這些並非用於顯示，"
"且不應與 Name 或 GenericName 的值重複。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:104
msgid "Startup WM Class"
msgstr "啟動視窗管理員類別"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:106
msgid ""
"If specified, the application will be requested to use the string as a WM "
"class or a WM name hint at least in one window."
msgstr ""
"若有指定，將會要求應用程式在至少一個視窗中使用此字串作為視窗管理員類別（WM "
"class）或視窗管理員名稱提示。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:113
msgid "Implements"
msgstr "實作"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:114
msgid "A list of interfaces that this application implements."
msgstr "此應用程式所實作介面的列表。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:120
msgid "Hidden"
msgstr "隱藏"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:122
msgid ""
"If set to \"True\", the result for the user is equivalent to the .desktop "
"file not existing at all."
msgstr "若設為「True」，對使用者而言其效果相當於該 .desktop 檔案完全不存在。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:129
msgid "DBUS Activatable"
msgstr "DBus 可啟動"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:131
msgid ""
"Set this key to \"True\" if D-Bus activation is supported for this "
"application and you want to use it."
msgstr "若此應用程式支援 D-Bus 啟動且您希望使用它，請將此鍵設為「True」。"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:138
msgid "Prefers Non-Default GPU"
msgstr "偏好非預設 GPU"

#: menuet/AdvancedPage.py:140
msgid ""
"Set this key to \"True\" if this application prefers to be run on a more "
"powerful GPU if available."
msgstr ""
"若此應用程式偏好在可用的情況下於效能更強大的 GPU 上執行，請將此鍵設為"
"「True」。"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:72
msgid "Add name"
msgstr "新增名稱"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:78
msgid "Add comment"
msgstr "新增備註"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:84
msgid "Application Details"
msgstr "應用程式詳細資料"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:98
msgid ""
"Program to execute with arguments. This key is required if DBusActivatable "
"is not set to \"True\" or if you need compatibility with implementations "
"that do not understand D-Bus activation."
msgstr ""
"要執行且帶有參數的程式。若未將 DBusActivatable 設為「True」，或是您需要相容於"
"不理解 D-Bus 啟動的實作，則此鍵為必填。"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:100
msgid "Supported Arguments"
msgstr "支援的參數"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:109
msgid "Working Directory"
msgstr "工作目錄"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:109
msgid "The working directory."
msgstr "工作目錄。"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:118
msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:127
msgid "Run in terminal"
msgstr "在終端機中執行"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:129
msgid "If set to \"True\", the program will be ran in a terminal window."
msgstr "若設為「True」，程式將會在終端機視窗中執行。"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:142
msgid "Use startup notification"
msgstr "使用啟動通知"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:145
msgid ""
"If set to \"True\", a startup notification is sent. Usually means that a "
"busy cursor is shown while the application launches."
msgstr ""
"若設為「True」，將會傳送啟動通知。通常代表應用程式啟動時會顯示忙碌游標。"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:159
msgid "Hide from menus"
msgstr "從選單中隱藏"

#: menuet/ApplicationEditor.py:162
msgid ""
"If set to \"True\", this entry will not be shown in menus, but will be "
"available for MIME type associations etc."
msgstr ""
"若設為「True」，此項目將不會顯示在選單中，但仍可應用於 MIME 類型關聯等用途。"

